[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
stalwart-migrate must match the Stalwart v1 server that will open the
migrated store:

- The stalwart-migrate package (default flavor, built without
  upstream's enterprise feature) writes a store that only a Stalwart
  server built without the enterprise feature can open.
- The official Stalwart binaries, with or without an Enterprise
  license, and Stalwart servers built with the enterprise feature
  need the stalwart-migrate-enterprise package (enterprise flavor).
  It contains code licensed under the Stalwart Enterprise License
  (SELv2), installed in %%PREFIX%%/share/licenses/; use of the
  enterprise features is subject to its terms.

The source must run Stalwart v0.16.27; upgrade earlier 0.16 releases
first. The target must run Stalwart v1.0.3 or later. The tool only
supports the backends selected when it was built. FoundationDB is not
supported by this port.

The manual is the upstream README.md (installed in
%%DOCSDIR%% with the DOCS option) and
https://github.com/stalwartlabs/stalwart-migrate
EOM
}
]
